    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/26d8e485dfb916b29bdf9e650ea04c88.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div>Crypterion is a new approach to visual novels, mixing open-world adventuring with a complex plot where every choice matters and no two playthroughs will ever be the same.\u00a0 Start by defining your character, navigate down a myriad of branching paths, and become the most powerful person in Rimshot. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/71fb8791ac48a2964e28fcbd429fd738.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/6deae316274852944b569d1313f7e2c7.poster.avif?t=1745942588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/6deae316274852944b569d1313f7e2c7.webm?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/6deae316274852944b569d1313f7e2c7.mp4?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique blend of visual novels, point-and-click adventures, and open-world exploration, with open-ended gameplay allowing you to decide which way to rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over two hundred choices branching the plot into multiple non-overlapping story arcs, fleshed out by a script totaling over 120,000 words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable main character with selectable preferences, dislikes, and more, which the game will react to - and more changes occur as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 6 unique planets of the Rimshot system, seeking a path to riches and power. Build a business, look for spoils, become a TV celebrity - and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failure is not an option: When your character stumbles, some paths close, others open - even if these lead to places where you have to work off your debt... Or launch a daring escape.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/af3aeef01a950dfb697626daecf9547a.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/fd36291ed3aa50857bf45bf0e1dda785.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with nearly 40 distinct characters, including eleven unique crewmates. A Saboteur, Genius, Stowaway, Mechanic, Security Officer, Informant, Cook, Doctor, Pilot, Guardian, and Secret Agent.\u00a0Build relations, forge lasting friendships, and even entertain marriage proposals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/e67bb2580c87fe5d9759513c44a4f105.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div>Players can submit questions on our Discord for a chance to be featured on the in-game TV show, <i>Face To Face\u00ae</i>! Join Sunny Dae, everyone\u2019s favorite TV host, as he asks hard-hitting questions to his guests. Plus, share your fan art with the community\u2014your work might be displayed in-game at locations like the gallery, auction house, treasury, and other points of interest!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/a30772a5b919bf282a1064ca9b447b39.poster.avif?t=1745942588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/a30772a5b919bf282a1064ca9b447b39.webm?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/a30772a5b919bf282a1064ca9b447b39.mp4?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/26d8e485dfb916b29bdf9e650ea04c88.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div>Crypterion is a new approach to visual novels, mixing open-world adventuring with a complex plot where every choice matters and no two playthroughs will ever be the same.\u00a0 Start by defining your character, navigate down a myriad of branching paths, and become the most powerful person in Rimshot. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/71fb8791ac48a2964e28fcbd429fd738.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/6deae316274852944b569d1313f7e2c7.poster.avif?t=1745942588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/6deae316274852944b569d1313f7e2c7.webm?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/6deae316274852944b569d1313f7e2c7.mp4?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique blend of visual novels, point-and-click adventures, and open-world exploration, with open-ended gameplay allowing you to decide which way to rise to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over two hundred choices branching the plot into multiple non-overlapping story arcs, fleshed out by a script totaling over 120,000 words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable main character with selectable preferences, dislikes, and more, which the game will react to - and more changes occur as you progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore 6 unique planets of the Rimshot system, seeking a path to riches and power. Build a business, look for spoils, become a TV celebrity - and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Failure is not an option: When your character stumbles, some paths close, others open - even if these lead to places where you have to work off your debt... Or launch a daring escape.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/af3aeef01a950dfb697626daecf9547a.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/fd36291ed3aa50857bf45bf0e1dda785.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with nearly 40 distinct characters, including eleven unique crewmates. A Saboteur, Genius, Stowaway, Mechanic, Security Officer, Informant, Cook, Doctor, Pilot, Guardian, and Secret Agent.\u00a0Build relations, forge lasting friendships, and even entertain marriage proposals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/e67bb2580c87fe5d9759513c44a4f105.avif?t=1745942588\" /></div>Players can submit questions on our Discord for a chance to be featured on the in-game TV show, <i>Face To Face\u00ae</i>! Join Sunny Dae, everyone\u2019s favorite TV host, as he asks hard-hitting questions to his guests. Plus, share your fan art with the community\u2014your work might be displayed in-game at locations like the gallery, auction house, treasury, and other points of interest!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/a30772a5b919bf282a1064ca9b447b39.poster.avif?t=1745942588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/a30772a5b919bf282a1064ca9b447b39.webm?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048860/extras/a30772a5b919bf282a1064ca9b447b39.mp4?t=1745942588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Crypterion is an open-world visual novel in a distant future where anyone can rise to power\u2014including you. As a new arrival in the Rimshot system, you are free to forge your own destiny, conquering space by mastery of trade, politics, celebrity status through galactic TV or... Other means.",
